---
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-brand-50 to-surface-50 py-16 sm:py-24 lg:py-32">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 text-sm font-medium mb-6 animate-in slide-in-from-bottom">
        <span class="relative flex h-2 w-2">
          <span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-brand-400 opacity-75"></span>
          <span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-brand-500"></span>
        </span>
        Prototipo en desarrollo · MVP en construcción
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-text-primary tracking-tight mb-6 animate-in slide-in-from-bottom">
        Cuentas claras, <span class="text-brand-600">amistades tranquilas</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-text-secondary max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10 animate-in slide-in-from-bottom" style="animation-delay: 100ms;">
        Registra y divide gastos compartidos entre compañeros, pareja, amigos o familia.
        Sin conflictos, sin confusiones, sin mover dinero real.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4 animate-in slide-in-from-bottom" style="animation-delay: 200ms;">
        <a href="/app/#/demo" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg gap-2">
          Probar demo sin registrarme
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6"/></svg>
        </a>
        <a href="/app/#/auth/login" class="btn btn-secondary btn-lg">Iniciar sesión</a>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6 max-w-2xl mx-auto animate-in slide-in-from-bottom" style="animation-delay: 300ms;">
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2 p-4 rounded-xl bg-surface-50 border border-border-primary">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-600" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 4.354a4 4 0 110 5.292M15 21H3v-1a6 6 0 0112 0v1zm0 0h6v-1a6 6 0 00-9-5.197M13 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z"/></svg>
          <span class="text-sm font-medium text-text-primary">Grupos para tus planes</span>
          <span class="text-xs text-text-tertiary">Apartamento, viajes, eventos</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2 p-4 rounded-xl bg-surface-50 border border-border-primary">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-600" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"/></svg>
          <span class="text-sm font-medium text-text-primary">Privacidad por diseño</span>
          <span class="text-xs text-text-tertiary">Tus datos, tu control</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2 p-4 rounded-xl bg-surface-50 border border-border-primary">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-600" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
          <span class="text-sm font-medium text-text-primary">Registro sencillo</span>
          <span class="text-xs text-text-tertiary">Para registrar un gasto</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    </div>

    <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none overflow-hidden" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="absolute top-20 left-10 w-72 h-72 bg-brand-100 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-50" />
      <div class="absolute bottom-20 right-10 w-96 h-96 bg-brand-200 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-30" />
    </div>
</section>